      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gambira Abaisraeli bareete enkoni, emwe omuri buri ruganda rwa baishenkurubo, zireetwe abeebembezi baabo, nk'amaju ga baishenkurubo oku gari, enkoni zoona zibe ikumi na ibiri. Ohandiikye eiziina rya buri muntu aha nkoni ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ohandiikye eiziina rya Arooni aha nkoni ya Leevi, ahakuba omukuru wa buri ruganda rwa baishenkuru naija kugira enkoni emwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 25:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ozibiikye omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu omu maisho g'Ebirikuhamya, ahu mbugaabuganira naimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.16.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 16:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Enkoni y'omushaija ou ndaatoorane neija kutooka, ntyo mmareho okwetomboita omu maisho gangye oku Abaisraeli barikubeetomboitera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaabigambira Abaisraeli, abeebembezi baabo boona baamuha enkoni, buri mwebembezi yaamuha emwe, nk'enganda za baishenkurubo oku zaabaire ziri, enkoni zoona ikumi na ibiri; kandi n'enkoni ya Arooni yaaziteebwamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 18:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 7:44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musa yaazita omu maisho ga MUKAMA omu Ihema ry'Ebirikuhamya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasheeshe Musa ku yaataahire omu Ihema ry'Ebirikuhamya, yaashanga enkoni ya Arooni, ey'oruganda rwa Leevi, etookire, erabize kandi ereetsire enjuma zihiisize ezirikwetwa endozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaashohoza enkoni zoona, naaziiha omu maisho ga MUKAMA, yaazireetera Abaisraeli boona, abo bakuru baazireeba, buri muntu yaatwara eye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 9:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.16.32+EXO.16.33+EXO.16.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 16:32-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Garura enkoni ya Arooni omu maisho g'Ebirikuhamya, ebiikwe kuba akamanyiso k'okwomesereza abagomi, obone kumaraho okwetomboita oku barikuunyetomboitera, barekye kufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo nikwo Musa yaakozire; nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire, yaaba nikwo yaakora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
